@* The Health module's own imports (D104 item 12). Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web is REQUIRED (BL-54): without
   it @onclick / @bind:event compile as plain HTML attributes, the module builds GREEN and renders, and every click
   is silently dead with no console error. For an IN-TREE Client module the line is redundant (the project-root
   src/Stomme.Client/_Imports.razor carries it and Razor imports cascade), and it is kept for the day the module
   leaves the Client project - an external or split module has no root import to inherit, which is exactly the shape
   BL-54 was measured on. *@
@using Microsoft.AspNetCore.Components.Web
@using Stomme.Models.Health
@using Stomme.Modules.Health.Services
@using Stomme.Health
